# Gooo owns the semantic contract; Go is only the generator, evaluator, and runtime.
language Gooo
contract gooo-bootstrap-fixed-point/v1
toolchain go1.27.0
source_read_only true

activity verifier.semantic_ir | canonical semantic IR is the verifier input
activity verifier.provenance_graph | provenance graph binds source to generated behavior
activity verifier.fixed_point | G1 and G2 are compared component by component
activity generator.go | Go is emitted as a generated execution artifact
activity evaluator.behavior | generated Go behavior is observed by the runner

stage G0 | bootstrap seed semantics
stage G1 | first semantic generation
stage G2 | regeneration from the same pinned input

precedence REFUTED>UNKNOWN>CLOSED
unknown_fields stage,step,reason,unknown_class,next_operation,blocked_by
proof canonical_semantic_ir,generated_go_behavior,generated_output,provenance_graph
bootstrap compiler=seed-compiler
bootstrap_trust UNPROVEN

canonical_case normal-semantic-ir
canonical_case normal-generated-behavior
canonical_case normal-provenance-graph
canonical_case unknown-bootstrap-trust
canonical_case unknown-external-user
canonical_case unknown-toolchain
canonical_case refuted-malformed
canonical_case refuted-unknown-decision
canonical_case refuted-precedence
